        </div>
        <div class="verify-item">
          <h4>Who handles structural design and detailing?</h4>
          <p>ZhongSai has an in-house structural design and detailing team that provides structural design coordination, connection detailing and fabrication drawing support based on project drawings and agreed scope. Design responsibility is determined by project contract and local regulations.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="verify-item">
          <h4>Who manages overseas project delivery?</h4>
          <p>ZhongSai's in-house project delivery team coordinates production schedules, component marking, packing plans, container loading, export documentation and shipping coordination to ensure components arrive at the destination port as planned.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="verify-item">
          <h4>Can buyers visit the factory?</h4>
          <p>Qualified project clients can arrange factory visits to our Guangdong production bases for manufacturing capability and quality control verification. Please contact our project team in advance to schedule a visit.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="verify-item">
          <h4>Can factory verification documents be provided?</h4>
          <p>For qualified project discussions, ZhongSai can provide business registration, quality system documents, factory verification materials and production records to support the buyer's supplier evaluation process.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>: Factory Verification -->
  <section class="hub-section hub-section-light">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hub-section-head">
